  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given integral,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Put <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now applying the integration by parts i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mi>u</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>u</mi></mfenced><msubsup><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8203;</mi></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
